{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40846-gmc-spirit-influences","id":40846,"title":"GMC - Spirit Influences","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-01T17:55:43-08:00","id":40846,"title":"GMC - Spirit Influences","content":"So, I'm still trying to get a grasp on the extent of Spirit Influences. Are the examples provided in the book the ONLY things that Influence can do?<br /> <br /> IE:<br /> <br /> \u2022 Strengthen: The entity can enhance its sphere of influence; it can add to the Defense of a loved one, make an emotion stronger, an animal or plant healthier, or an object more robust, gaining the entity\u2019s Rank in Health or Structure. This Influence can shift the Anchor, Resonant or Infrastructure Condition to Open for its duration. The cost is one Essence.<br /> <br /> With Strengthen, could a Spirit of Murder give a murderer a bonus to actions that are intended to produce a murder? Could it give a weapon bonus to a murder weapon? Could they give Armour to a murderer instead of Defense/Health? <br /> <br /> With Rank 3 Control, could a Spirit of Despair effectively make puppets out of depressed people? Can a Spirit of Dogs control packs of animals and make them do as it wishes? If they can, then what do they need the Possession Manifestation effect for?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1443-murderbunny","name":"Murderbunny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T18:34:36-08:00","id":40870,"title":"","content":"Definitely not limited by the examples, there are spirits of pretty much everything.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murderbunny</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40846-gmc-spirit-influences#post40846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With Strengthen, could a Spirit of Murder give a murderer a bonus to actions that are intended to produce a murder? Could it give a weapon bonus to a murder weapon? Could they give Armour to a murderer instead of Defense/Health?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes., yes, I'd suggest armour isn't really in the purview of murder.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murderbunny</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40846-gmc-spirit-influences#post40846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With Rank 3 Control, could a Spirit of Despair effectively make puppets out of depressed people? Can a Spirit of Dogs control packs of animals and make them do as it wishes? If they can, then what do they need the Possession Manifestation effect for?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. Yes. Possession is cheaper from an essence standpoint and allows for more direct control over a longer period of time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 01-01-2014, 09:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T19:03:36-08:00","id":40885,"title":"","content":"Thanks Nofather.<br /> <br /> I guess such bonuses are limited by a spirit's rank. So a rank 3 Murder spirit could give a serial killer it fancies +3 to actions that are attempts to murder someone, right?<br /> <br /> I gather that each &quot;buff&quot; a spirit gives counts as one influence action, and thus they pay the requisite Essence for each thing they do. The Dog spirit spends 1 Essence to give a bonus to a dog's Defense, another Essence to give a bonus to the dog's health, another Essence to give it a bonus to doglike actions (ie, biting, burying bones, tracking by scent), correct? Not one Essence payment for multiple buffs at once?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1443-murderbunny","name":"Murderbunny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T20:43:50-08:00","id":41487,"title":"","content":"Also, how much Essence can an ephemeral entity spend per turn? I can't find it anywhere...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1443-murderbunny","name":"Murderbunny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T20:47:49-08:00","id":41491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murderbunny</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40846-gmc-spirit-influences?p=41487#post41487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, how much Essence can an ephemeral entity spend per turn? I can't find it anywhere...</div> </div> </div> </div>That'd be because there isn't one, aside from &quot;their maximum capacity.&quot;<br /> <br /> Action types tend to be the more restrictive elements of how much spirits can do with their Essence in a given turn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T22:28:32-07:00","id":942503,"title":"","content":"Can Influence be used to attack? Like a lightning spirit calling down a bolt?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T03:28:52-07:00","id":942610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>K9ine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40846-gmc-spirit-influences?p=942503#post942503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can Influence be used to attack? Like a lightning spirit calling down a bolt?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but it costs much more essence than say, Blast, and it's usually only feasible starting at rank 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T06:52:20-07:00","id":942681,"title":"","content":"Influences <i>can</i> do nearly anything, but Numina, being more focused, are usually far more efficient.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T09:20:34-07:00","id":942751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/40846-gmc-spirit-influences?p=942681#post942681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Influences <i>can</i> do nearly anything, but Numina, being more focused, are usually far more efficient.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is what I mean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}